      "difficulty": "Easy",
      "prompt": "The solution of $\\frac{dy}{dt}=ky$, $y(0)=y_0$ is:\nA) $y_0+kt$\nB) $y_0 e^{kt}$\nC) $y_0 t^k$\nD) $e^{y_0 t}$",
      "answer": "B) $y_0 e^{kt}$",
      "solution": {
        "steps": [
          "Proportional rate gives exponential. Key is B."
        ],
        "answer": "B) $y_0 e^{kt}$"
      }
    },
    {
